      47.85,
      399.13,
      539.94,
      446.32
    ],
    "text": "IT is hereby notified that by virtue of powers vested in me under Section 17 of the Customs Ordinance (Chapter 235)I, K. A. Vimalenthirarajah, Acting Director General of Customs, determine that with effect from 18th December, 2017, all dutiesof Customs as well as other charges, penalties and forfeitures incurred under the Customs Ordinance (Chapter 235), shall bepaid and received at the Rates of Exchange set out in the Schedule .",
